{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Dismau</i></strong> is a semi-open world action-adventure RPG set in the lush and mystical forests of <u>Nordic</u> mythology. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take control of <strong><i>Jorik</i></strong>, a small forest elf on a mission to rescue his scattered kin after a violent troll invasion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By teaming up with a clever housemouse companion named <strong><i>Kip</i></strong>, and earning the trust of various <u>woodland creatures</u>, players unlock unique animal abilities to navigate puzzles, dungeons, and stealth-based encounters.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840930?t=1759853068","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840930/8d8485b347357fabdd78b3ae700073012c600a50/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759853068","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840930/7501a8e08083787a6991048d77b10fd0d5dd0af1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759853068","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840930/7501a8e08083787a6991048d77b10fd0d5dd0af1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759853068","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Dismau</i></strong> is a semi-open world action-adventure RPG set in the lush and mystical forests of <u>Nordic</u> mythology. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take control of <strong><i>Jorik</i></strong>, a small forest elf on a mission to rescue his scattered kin after a violent troll invasion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By teaming up with a clever housemouse companion named <strong><i>Kip</i></strong>, and earning the trust of various <u>woodland creatures</u>, players unlock unique animal abilities to navigate puzzles, dungeons, and stealth